============================================================
Local databases and database artifacts
============================================================

*.sqlite *.sqlite3 *.sqlite3-journal *.db *.dump *.backup

Do not ignore SQL schema, migration scripts, or database tests.
Keep real database credentials in .env, never in tracked files.
